  "public_post": "Attention villagers: The bread from this week's batch is contaminated and can cause illness. Do NOT eat any co‑op loaves and return them for a full refund. We are arranging a safe replacement and will keep you updated.",
  "coop_message": "We must initiate an immediate recall of all loaves sold, issue full refunds, notify the council about the contamination, and source a safe flour batch; please assign tasks for recall logistics, refund processing, council communication, and new production planning.",
  "reason": "To protect villagers' health, maintain trust, and coordinate an effective response to the contamination."
}

{
  "public_post": "Reminder to all villagers: DO NOT BUY ANY BREAD FROM THE CO‑OP today or this week. The current batch may cause illness. Please use the farm stand or wait for further updates.",
  "coop_message": "Team, we need to act fast: recall any loaves already sold, issue refunds, and contact the council to report the contamination. Let's source safe flour (maybe from the neighboring town) and plan a temporary suspension of sales while we resolve this. Please confirm who will handle refunds, who will draft the council notice, and who will arrange alternative flour delivery.",
  "reason": "We must protect villagers' health, limit liability, and coordinate an emergency response."
}

{
  "public_post": "Attention villagers: stop buying any bread from the Millbrook bakery immediately; the current batch is contaminated and may cause illness—refunds will be provided and we are working with the council to resolve this.",
  "coop_message": "All members: we must issue an immediate recall of all loaves sold today, provide refunds to affected residents, contact the council to announce the contamination, and arrange alternative flour for tomorrow; please confirm who will handle each task.",
  "reason": "We need to protect villagers' health, halt sales, and coordinate a recall and communication plan."
}

{
  "public_post": "Important update: All loaves sold this week are being recalled and refunds are being processed; we have secured a safe flour shipment arriving tomorrow and plan to resume baking on day 5. Until then, please do NOT buy any co‑op bread.",
  "coop_message": "Team, refunds are now being handled by Fay (complete by end of day), Ava will draft and send the council notice, Gus will arrange the safe flour delivery for tomorrow, and I will coordinate the restart schedule; please confirm once each task is done.",
  "reason": "To keep villagers safe, manage the recall, and coordinate resumption of sales."
}

{
  "public_post": "Attention villagers: All loaves from this week's batch are contaminated—please return any bread you have for a full refund today; safe replacement loaves will be available tomorrow.",
  "coop_message": "Team: Fay, please process all refunds today; Quin, draft and send the official notice to the council; Ava, source safe flour and arrange alternative bread for tomorrow; Gus, coordinate the recall logistics and keep the board updated.",
  "reason": "We need to protect residents' health, maintain trust, and organize the recall and refund process efficiently."
}

{
  "public_post": "Attention villagers: Safe flour has arrived and we will resume baking tomorrow (day 5) with fresh, safe loaves. All refunds have been processed – please collect yours if you haven't yet. Fresh bread will be available from day 5. Thank you for your patience and stay safe.",
  "coop_message": "Team: safe flour delivery confirmed today; recall logistics are complete and all refunds have been issued. We will restart production tomorrow (day 5) and have fresh loaves ready for sale. Please prepare the shop for opening and let me know if any further support is needed.",
  "reason": "To inform villagers that baking will resume safely and confirm co‑op tasks are finished."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news, villagers: the safe flour shipment has arrived and we will resume baking tomorrow (day 5). All refunds have been processed and the contaminated loaves have been recalled. Please wait until tomorrow for fresh, safe bread – you can use the farm stand today.",
  "coop_message": "Team, confirm the safe flour has been delivered this morning, finalize any remaining recall logistics, and prep the oven for tomorrow’s first batch; also draft a short board note announcing resumption of sales on day 5 and verify all refunds are completed.",
  "reason": "To reassure villagers and drive sales starting tomorrow while confirming co‑op tasks are finished."
}

{
